+                // RDP hung -- it nulls curRDPTask and resets the DP registers,
+                // WITHOUT clearing OS_SC_NEEDS_RDP on the task. A DP edge landing
+                // after that point walks into __scHandleRDP with curRDPTask == 0
+                // and dereferences null.
+                //
+                // The threshold is counted in RETRACES PROCESSED, not in
+                // milliseconds -- gCurRDPTaskCounter is reset in __scExec when a
+                // task starts and incremented once per __scHandleRetrace. The
+                // first draft of this comment claimed a software Glide frame
+                // blows a 167 ms budget; the measurement below refutes that
+                // outright, worst case 60 ms over a thousand frames. What the
+                // delay costs is not time but retraces landing in between.
+                //
+                // The run averages 3238 VIDEO messages against 567 RDP_DONE --
+                // about six retraces per display list, comfortably under eleven
